@@ -0,0 +1,330 @@
+/- GID: D5/S3/ConceptDynamics/Coding/PrimitiveLifts/PrimeOrbitRootCriterion
+   generality: G
+   mirror-B: D5/B/S3/ConceptDynamics/Coding/PrimitiveLifts/PrimeOrbitRootCriterion
+   mirror-E: none(waiver:symbolic-structural-theorems)
