+  · exact source_chart_legal _ _ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
+  · exact source_chart_legal _ _ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
+  · exact source_chart_legal _ _ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
+  · exact source_chart_legal _ _ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
